WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.080
I'm here practising for the Rakahuri Rage,

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.899
a team mountain biking event

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:10.320
down at the Ashley River, on Sunday the 12th of March.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.320
The Rakahui Rage is a six hour event

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.180
in which teams of 2-4 riders

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.420
compete in a relaxed and social atmosphere.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.740
Riders, young and old

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.760
of all abilities, compete safely in

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.040
a fun environment.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.880
You might wonder why I'm riding down here at

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.980
the Dudley Aquatic Centre.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.760
Well, all proceeds from the event, go towards supporting

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.880
the Mainpower WaiSwim programme, which teaches

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.300
our kids to swim and be safe in the water.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.640
So whether your a lycra-wearing speed freak

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.860
or a weekend warrior, there's a place in the

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.719
Rakahuri Rage for you. Get a team together

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:51.210
or your family and come join me on

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.570
Sunday 12th of March.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.429
The race is open to all riders 12 years

00:00:57.429 --> 00:00:59.350
and older with a variety of categories

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:02.530
to suit everyone and anyone.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:06.690
Click on the link below to find out more and register.

